# streamstudio: the HuggingFace cache its dataset pickers read

# HF_HOME=~/.cache/huggingface   HuggingFace cache folder; read at import, so restart the editor after changing it (README.md)
# PROJECT_ROOT=~/work   a folder: the file browser's PROJECT_ROOT button jumps there; unset or not a folder, no button (docs/editor.md)
# DATA_ROOT=~/data   a folder: the file browser's DATA_ROOT button jumps there; unset or not a folder, no button (docs/editor.md)
# MODEL_ROOT=~/models   a folder: the file browser's MODEL_ROOT button jumps there; unset or not a folder, no button (docs/editor.md)
# RUN_DIR=~/runs   a folder: the file browser's RUN_DIR button jumps there; unset or not a folder, no button (docs/editor.md)

# not for .env: STREAMSTUDIO_PAGE_CHECK — set by streamstudio for a process it starts to serve, handing over its page-build check
